# Install as .github/CODEOWNERS and replace REPLACE_ORG and the team names.
# The last matching pattern wins, so the catch-all must stay first.
# Owners must be human teams with write access; never add an agent or its App.

# Catch-all. With the ruleset's code-owner review, every PR needs a human
# owner's approval, so an agent App's approval can never satisfy it (P0.3, P0.9).
*                               @Yimunan

# Tests, fixtures and snapshots
tests/                          @Yimunan
test/                           @Yimunan
**/tests/                       @Yimunan
**/__tests__/                   @Yimunan
**/fixtures/                    @Yimunan
**/__fixtures__/                @Yimunan
**/__snapshots__/               @Yimunan
**/snapshots/                   @Yimunan
*.snap                          @Yimunan

